# ── Agent runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bind mounts created next to each agent. They hold credentials, sessions,
# skills, and installed dependency trees: machine-local, often large, never
# source. `.DHC` is what `.deps` was called before the project was renamed.
**/.harness/
**/.deps/
**/.DHC/

# Residents: each one's state, workspace and identity is machine-local. Only
# the committed examples under examples/residents/ are source.
/residents/

# The dorm commons: messages agents send each other. Runtime data, not source.
/commons/

# What a harness scaffolds into its work root on first run, for when someone
# launches an agent from inside its own directory in this repo. Scoped to
# agents/ so a top-level AGENTS.md for contributors stays trackable.
agents/*/AGENTS.md
agents/*/BOOTSTRAP.md
agents/*/DREAMS.md
agents/*/HEARTBEAT.md
agents/*/IDENTITY.md
agents/*/MEMORY.md
agents/*/SOUL.md
agents/*/TOOLS.md
agents/*/USER.md
agents/*/memory/
agents/*/workspace/

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Provider API keys live in the environment, never in the tree. `.env.example`
# is the checked-in template and stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/lib/**/*.key

# ── Local overrides ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docker-compose.override.yml
dorm.local.yaml
.direnv/

# ── Editors and OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Build and language leftovers ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing here is built from source today, but agents run inside these folders
# and their tooling leaves traces behind.
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ── Logs and scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
tmp/
scratch/
